Maria Lopez: "That's fascinating—the idea of organized resistance actively delaying a phase transition in a social system. It brings up a huge variable: what does the 'social momentum' look like compared to a physical force? In physics, you can model the forces, but the social variables feel so much more... qualitative. I guess I need to get back to my stream before my study time gets too intense, but it was really refreshing talking about this; you've given me a lot to think about regarding complex adaptive systems!"


